# Root Hygiene

- Treat repository root as production-critical surface.
- Do not add temporary reports, one-off scripts, backups, or generated artifacts to root.
- Place SQL migrations under `supabase/migrations/`.
- Place governance automation under `scripts/governance/`.
- Place documentation under `docs/` unless it is core root metadata (`README.md`, `package.json`, `tsconfig*.json`, `vite.config.ts`).
- Remove generated cache files (for example `*.tsbuildinfo`) and keep them gitignored.
- Before deleting root files, verify they are not build/runtime requirements.
